asgs-mon available checks
=========================

Checks live here and are enabled by symlinking them into ../active.

Prefer the command line:

  asgs-mon --list
  asgs-mon --enable 003
  asgs-mon --disable 003
  asgs-mon --check 003
  asgs-mon --check atcf

Numeric prefixes control execution/display order. Descriptive checks without a
numeric prefix are also supported and sort after numbered checks.

`atcf-sanity` is intentionally disabled by default. Enable it after validating
it against the target TC profile with `asgs-mon --check atcf`.

New Bash checks should source _bash-helper-functions.sh and call mon_init "$@".
See ../examples/check-template.bash and the main README.md.
